# Field control-shell rest gradient

`.template-card-field` + `.template-card-control-shell` rest overlay (`::before`) must stay visible on first paint for **every current field and every new field** that uses this atom.

- Default `::before` **opacity 1**. Do **not** transition opacity (re-applying `.template-card-surface-gradient` restarts a fade = reload thrash).
- Do **not** hide the overlay because the value is empty, `:placeholder-shown`, or `data-settings-surface="empty"`. Empty vs filled is placeholder vs value only.
- Readonly/disabled shells are not focus-surfaces that hide `::before`.
- Presentation sync must be idempotent. Do not schedule 120ms/600ms full resyncs.

Settings view-mode info shells (`.template-settings-info-shell`) inherit this; do not add Username-only exceptions.

Contracts: `portal/tests/unit/css/template-card-control-shell-gradient.test.mjs`, `portal/tests/unit/ui/card-field-presentation-sync.test.mjs`, `portal/tests/unit/css/settings-view-mode-rest-gradient.test.mjs`.
